{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "t1_a",
  "tier": 1,
  "name": "Security Network A",
  "cellSizeM": 2.0,
  "notes": [
    "Tier 1 'gentle start': all patrols are solo, no paired robots, no MFA, no carts, no hardened gates. All three routes always classify FREE.",
    "Route A (top): loop section patrolled by a solo robot cycling around the block at x20-27. Two code-note alcoves and a token reserve sit upstream of the keypad-capable slots.",
    "Route B (middle): optional conveyor shutter at B2 (platforms either side). Service-door robot paces x22-27 only if B3 becomes a service door; three alcoves along its beat allow rear approaches.",
    "Route C (bottom): optional service-door robot at x11-16 for C2, ambient robot at x22-28 that grants T1_MAINT (a carry-over reward for tier 2). C1/C3 can host camera corridors with nearby cover.",
    "Decoy branches DA1, DB1, DC1 are chambers (dead end, honeypot door or honeypot terminal); DA2, DB2, DC2 are short corridors (dead end or honeypot door).",
    "Shared exit room has one fixed camera at cell [38,8]. The exit trigger is cell [37,10]."
  ],
